# {{lb|en|British spelling}} {{alternative form of|en|luster}}: A [[5]]-[[year]] [[period]], [[especially]] {{lb|en|historical}} in [[Roman]] [[context]]s.

===Etymology 3===
From {{der|en|la|lustrum|lustra|[[wilds]], [[woods]]}}, thought to derive from unattested {{m|la|*dustrum}}, from unattested {{der|en|grc|*δύστρον||[[place]] [[animal]]s [[wallow]]}}, from {{m|grc|δύω||to [[plunge]], to [[wallow]]}}.

